msgctxt "Languages::ab__ia_prices__tooltip"
msgid "Price range of selected products. <br><b>0-0</b> - products of all costs;<br><b>0-10000</b> - products with a price of up to 10000; <br><b>10000-0</b> - products with priced from 10000; <b>10000-20000</b> - products with a price between 10000 and 20000. The value by default can be set in the add-on settings"
